stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Validating: save
  Validating --> Draft: schema or security-floor error
  Validating --> Evaluating: valid
  Evaluating --> Draft: below release threshold
  Evaluating --> Published: thresholds met (immutable version)
  Published --> Staging: promote
  Staging --> Production: promote
  Production --> Production: rollback to earlier version
  Production --> [*]: retired
  note right of Evaluating
    Eval + isolation suites run automatically.
    Studio shows config diff and score diff.
  end note
